module Core

# ============================================================================
# W-dispatched atan table-reduction primitives: atan_tab(k)=atan(k/32) (k=1..32; k<=0 -> +0),
# atan_h(w)=even Remez minimax of atan(sqrt w)/sqrt w on [0,(1/64)^2]. Used by UnpackedFloat.atan2_p to
# replace the depth half-angle reduction (div+sqrt/step) with one div + short poly. Originally generated
# by playground/gen_atan_tables.py for five widths; pruned to the live N=2 (W=128) and N=3 (W=192)
# engines, so edit by hand from here.
# ============================================================================

